{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless chaos reverberates throughout a world where the only constant is war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an effort to overcome the turmoil, the people decide to create a super-loli. But this white-haired, god-like entity has\u2026 a major case of social anxiety?! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She turns the once apocalyptic, barren world into a new one filled with races and civilizations previously known only from mythology and fairy tales, and grants the mysterious power of The Source to its inhabitants, including humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice of Belldona takes place in this fantastic world created by Cheryl and tells the story of her adventures after being unexpectedly awakened again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/931c187ae320ce76b378e53265fff498.poster.avif?t=1759920401\" width=620 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/931c187ae320ce76b378e53265fff498.webm?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/931c187ae320ce76b378e53265fff498.mp4?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/64298acd8be5e22d7cad63eda8c485ed.avif?t=1759920401\" width=602 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the powerful Sourcerer Griza or the mighty Warrior Rinna.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure, collecting resources, buffs, armies, weapons, and deadly skill cards, through a series of unique narrative missions. Two characters. Two completely different combat systems. Gorgeously rendered ultimate skill animations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/9e009fdce17a83d4816757e3bcd7e233.poster.avif?t=1759920401\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/9e009fdce17a83d4816757e3bcd7e233.webm?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/9e009fdce17a83d4816757e3bcd7e233.mp4?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/68e1399f77939255b28573b7effaa1dc.poster.avif?t=1759920401\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/68e1399f77939255b28573b7effaa1dc.webm?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/68e1399f77939255b28573b7effaa1dc.mp4?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/9340d2e0412c4c00b03756c6ecc560c4.avif?t=1759920401\" width=602 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a powerful character uniquely yours, using preset decks with different playing styles as well as the cards and buffs you collect during your adventures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/5961620794aaedb88ccfc218de63957a.poster.avif?t=1759920401\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/5961620794aaedb88ccfc218de63957a.webm?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/5961620794aaedb88ccfc218de63957a.mp4?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/6beae60a532559eb9c751f9a02e4aec5.avif?t=1759920401\" width=602 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared. Your enemies will be strong... very strong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/df2301fd3b1d85c2dd45229f2db75a84.poster.avif?t=1759920401\" width=620 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/df2301fd3b1d85c2dd45229f2db75a84.webm?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/df2301fd3b1d85c2dd45229f2db75a84.mp4?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/addbeb1852d856ddd55bba4b4b6137bb.avif?t=1759920401\" width=602 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical raptors. Pegasus cavalry. Flesh-tearing Harpies. Gain air superiority with amazing flying units never before seen in a roguelike card game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/71994a41de748160536f7fb135133ff1.poster.avif?t=1759920401\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/71994a41de748160536f7fb135133ff1.webm?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/71994a41de748160536f7fb135133ff1.mp4?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy powerful aerial units to dominate the skies and disrupt enemy lines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/4639c47e016abbe923246a2d27d3b94c.poster.avif?t=1759920401\" width=540 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/4639c47e016abbe923246a2d27d3b94c.webm?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/4639c47e016abbe923246a2d27d3b94c.mp4?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/ddd26af8ba61088348a07e3e2cacaebc.avif?t=1759920401\" width=602 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter an enigmatic non-human redhead, a critically wounded imperial officer, a lizard nun\u2014yes, you read that right!\u2014, a mysterious goblin collector who never reveals his face... and many more. In Voice of Belldona, weave your own story interacting with unforgettable characters you meet along the way.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2223420?t=1759920401","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759920401","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/66f0a2c45277d8b45be30ba40921f9c800f85fea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759920401","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/66f0a2c45277d8b45be30ba40921f9c800f85fea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759920401","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Some Nudity or Sexual Content, General Mature Content. Some characters wear revealing clothing, and there are elements of combat and violence, but it does not include any sex acts, drug/alcohol abuse, or self-harm-related content."},"demos":[{"appid":2382030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Us</h1><p><br><br>Join our Discord to tell us your thoughts, report game issues, and stay updated with the latest news about Voice of Belldona!</p><br><h1>Recommended for you</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless chaos reverberates throughout a world where the only constant is war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an effort to overcome the turmoil, the people decide to create a super-loli. But this white-haired, god-like entity has\u2026 a major case of social anxiety?! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She turns the once apocalyptic, barren world into a new one filled with races and civilizations previously known only from mythology and fairy tales, and grants the mysterious power of The Source to its inhabitants, including humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice of Belldona takes place in this fantastic world created by Cheryl and tells the story of her adventures after being unexpectedly awakened again. </p>