" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/68e1399f77939255b28573b7effaa1dc.poster.avif?t=1759920401\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/68e1399f77939255b28573b7effaa1dc.webm?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/68e1399f77939255b28573b7effaa1dc.mp4?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/9340d2e0412c4c00b03756c6ecc560c4.avif?t=1759920401\" width=602 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a powerful character uniquely yours, using preset decks with different playing styles as well as the cards and buffs you collect during your adventures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/5961620794aaedb88ccfc218de63957a.poster.avif?t=1759920401\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/5961620794aaedb88ccfc218de63957a.webm?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/5961620794aaedb88ccfc218de63957a.mp4?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/6beae60a532559eb9c751f9a02e4aec5.avif?t=1759920401\" width=602 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared. Your enemies will be strong... very strong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/df2301fd3b1d85c2dd45229f2db75a84.poster.avif?t=1759920401\" width=620 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/df2301fd3b1d85c2dd45229f2db75a84.webm?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/df2301fd3b1d85c2dd45229f2db75a84.mp4?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/addbeb1852d856ddd55bba4b4b6137bb.avif?t=1759920401\" width=602 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical raptors. Pegasus cavalry. Flesh-tearing Harpies. Gain air superiority with amazing flying units never before seen in a roguelike card game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/71994a41de748160536f7fb135133ff1.poster.avif?t=1759920401\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/71994a41de748160536f7fb135133ff1.webm?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/71994a41de748160536f7fb135133ff1.mp4?t=1759920401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy powerful aerial units to dominate the skies and disrupt enemy lines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loo